<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Raju's Website</title>

<style>
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        color: white;
    }

    header {
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 10px;
    }

    nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: white;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
        color: yellow;
    }

    .hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero button {
        padding: 12px 25px;
        border: none;
        background: #ff7a18;
        color: white;
        border-radius: 25px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 16px;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .hero button:hover {
        background: #ffb347;
    }

    .cards {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 40px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        width: 250px;
        text-align: center;
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>🚀 Raju's Dummy Website</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Services</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    <p>This is a beautiful gradient UI website 🌈</p>
    <br>
    <button onclick="showMessage()">Click Me</button>
</section>

<section class="cards">
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Web Dev</h3>
        <p>Build modern websites</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h3>App Dev</h3>
        <p>Create mobile apps</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h3>AI Tools</h3>
        <p>Smart automation solutions</p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Raju Kumar | All Rights Reserved
</footer>

<script>
    function showMessage() {
        alert("🔥 Welcome Raju! Your website is working perfectly!");
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
```
